# Begin(o,s,p): an admitted start records a queued operation.
MODULE: SchemaDurableOperation
ROW: Begin(o,s,p)
FILE: src/lattice/Operations/LatticeOperationGrain.cs
DETECTORS: LatticeOperationGrainTests.Begin_records_a_queued_operation_and_indexes_it
SUMMARY: an admitted start records a running rather than a queued operation

--- FIND
            State = LatticeOperationState.Queued,
--- REPLACE
            State = LatticeOperationState.Running,
--- END
